# The woodcutter's own figures: out of his door, out along the free walk, at the cut, and back with the log. The layout
# sets up the hut; each fast-forward stops at a moment, and each shot crops around the node the woodcutter stands on then.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh woodcutter-figures --layout layouts/woodcutter.jsonc --fps 10
wait 0.3
fast-forward woodcutter state 4 max 20000
scroll up 6 1056 520
wait 0.3
shot door 13 10 1 4
fast-forward woodcutter state 0x10 max 20000
wait 0.3
shot out 14 11 1 4
fast-forward woodcutter state 0x11 max 20000
wait 0.3
shot cut 18 10 1 4
fast-forward woodcutter carrying max 20000
wait 0.3
shot back 18 10 1 4
